Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:34:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] fix(gateway): replace retired NIM DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
 on the nim-deepseek rung

The owner's live probe (audit_providers.py --probe-nvidia, 2026-11-17)
returned HTTP 410 for deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4.1-flash, so ladder rung 4
always failed over. The rung now uses nvidia/nemotron-3.5-super-vl-120b-a12b,
which the same probe confirmed working on the free NIM tier. Route name and
ladder order are unchanged; clip-fast stays Nemotron 3 Ultra. Unarmed
bake-off aliases are annotated DEAD (410/404) or LIVE from the probe.

Test pin updated in test_litellm_gateway_config.py (the pinned slug is the
retired model, proven by the probe). MODEL_REGISTRY row updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
